[
  {"id":"projects","label":"All projects","path":"/projects","aliases":["projects","my projects","project list","all projects","browse projects","create a linked project","choose project host folder","project folder on Nebula host"],"guide":"Browse and select existing projects, including archived ones. Butler can create a new project with a managed workspace or ask the paired browser to choose a Nebula-host folder for a linked project. Core reads back the saved workspace path; Host command access still needs operator consent. This does not relink an existing project."},
