  {"id":"reports","label":"Reports","path":"/projects/{project_id}/reports","aliases":["reports","deliverables","report drafts","report sign-off","report PDF","engagement bundle"],"guide":"Butler can page the selected project's reports, inspect a saved revision and its source findings or notes, and ask this browser to create or edit a draft. The Reports screen keeps final sign-off with the operator's own identity and attestation. PDF and sensitive engagement bundle exports download only to the requesting device after browser confirmation; Butler receives no file bytes."},
  {"id":"chat","label":"Chat","path":"/projects/{project_id}/workbench?view=chat","aliases":["chat","workbench","sessions","conversations","assistant conversations","Assistant settings","switch chat provider","switch from harness to provider","change conversation runtime","goal settings","goal resume instruction","resume goal prompt","goal budgets","step budgets","Butler conversations","Butler chats","archived Butler chats","pinned chats","pin chat","unpin chat","flagged chats","set chat flag","clear chat flag","chat flags","edit chat message","rewind chat","retract message","conversation history","chat transcript","export transcript","plan before acting","chat planning","bulk chat actions","select conversations","archive selected chats","delete selected chats","bulk archive chats","bulk delete chats"],"guide":"Open Conversations, choose Select conversations, select individual chats or all matches, choose Archive, Restore, Pin, Unpin, Flag, Clear flag, or Delete permanently, then Apply. Core readback confirms each result; deletion requires operator confirmation."},
